## 📁 Repository Structure

| Folder | Contents |
|--------|----------|
| `report/` | Final written report |
| `code/` | Notebooks and scripts |
| `data/` | Datasets used |
| `docs/images/` | Figures and screenshots |

## ▶️ How to Run

1. Clone the repo: `git clone https://github.com/fardeenshahanshah/Fundamentals-of-AI---Group-Coursework-H5-.git`
2. Install requirements: `pip install -r requirements.txt`
3. Open `code/[your-notebook].ipynb` and run all cells

